hadiths[9]{hadithnumber,text}:
"865","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Sa'd Sa'idi (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Uwaimir Ajlani Asim bin Adi Ansari ke paas aaya aur us se kaha: Ae Asim! Batao, agar koi mard apni biwi ke saath kisi mard ko paye to kya wo usay qatl kar de phir tum usay qatl kar do ge, ya wo kaisay karay? To mere liye is ke baaray mein Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poocho. To Asim ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poocha. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne sawalon ko napasand kiya aur usay bura samjha, yahan tak ke Asim par wo bhaari ho gaya jo unhon ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna tha. Phir jab Asim apne ghar walon ke paas wapas aaye to un ke paas Uwaimir aaya aur kaha: Ae Asim! Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne tum se kya kaha? To Asim ne Uwaimir se kaha: Tum mere paas khair le kar nahi aaye. Beshak Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us sawal ko napasand kiya jis ke baaray mein main ne Aap se poocha tha. Uwaimir ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main nahi rukun ga yahan tak ke main Aap se is ke baaray mein poochun. To Uwaimir aaya yahan tak ke wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas pahuncha jabke Aap logon ke darmiyan thay. To us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Bataiye, aik mard apni biwi ke saath kisi mard ko paye to kya wo usay qatl kar de phir tum usay qatl kar do ge, ya wo kaisay karay? To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tumharay aur tumhari biwi ke baaray mein (aayat) naazil ho gayi hai. To jao aur usay le aao. Sahl ne kaha: To un donon ne lian kiya jabke main logon ke saath Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas tha. Phir jab donon farigh hue to Uwaimir ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Main ne us par jhoot bandha hai agar main usay rakhun. To us ne usay teen talaqein de din is se pehle ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) usay hukm detay. Ibn Shihab ne kaha: To ye lian karnay walon ki sunnat ho gayi. (Muslim: 4/205)"
"866","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Sa'd bin Ubada (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Agar main apne ghar walon ke saath kisi mard ko paun to main usay haath na lagaun yahan tak ke chaar gawah laun. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: Hargiz nahi, us Zaat ki qasam jis ne Aap ko haq ke saath bheja hai, beshak main us se pehle usay talwaar se maar dun ga. Unhon ne kaha: To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Suno jo tumharay sardar kehtay hain. Beshak wo bohat ghairat wala hai, aur main us se zyada ghairat wala hun, aur Allah mujh se zyada ghairat wala hai. (Muslim: 4/210)"
"867","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Jubair se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Mus'ab (bin Zubair) ki hukumat mein lian karnay walon ke baaray mein poocha gaya ke kya un donon ke darmiyan judai ki jaye gi? Unhon ne kaha: To mujhe maloom na tha ke main kya kahun. To main Makka mein Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ke ghar ki taraf gaya aur ghulam se kaha: Mere liye ijazat maango. Us ne kaha: Beshak wo dopahar ko aaram kartay hain. To unhon ne meri awaz suni. Ibn Jubair ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: Dakhil ho jao, Allah ki qasam tum kisi kaam se aaye ho. To main dakhil hua to wo bichay hue bistar par baithay thay aur khajoor ki chhaal bharay takiye se tek lagaye hue thay. Main ne kaha: Ae Abu Abdur Rahman! Kya lian karnay walon ke darmiyan judai ki jaye gi? Unhon ne kaha: SubhanAllah! Beshak judai ki jaye gi. Aur sab se pehle is muamlay ke baaray mein Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se falan bin falan ne poocha tha. Us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Bataiye, agar ham mein se koi apni biwi ko buray kaam mein dekhay to wo kya karay? Agar wo bolay to bari baat hai, aur agar wo khamosh rahay to aisi bari baat par kaisay khamosh rahay? To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ye sun kar khamosh rahay aur jawab na diya. Phir wo shakhs Aap ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Wo muamla jis ke baaray mein main ne Aap se poocha tha, main khud us mein par gaya hun. Phir Allah Taala ne Sura-e-Noor mein ye aayaat naazil farmayin: Aur jo apni biwiyon par tohmat lagatay hain, aakhir tak. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne usay ye aayaat padh kar sunayin aur usay nasihat ki aur bataya ke duniya ka azaab aakhirat ke azaab se aasan hai. Us ne kaha: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ne Aap ko haq ke saath bheja hai, main ne apni biwi par jhoot nahi bandha. Phir Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aurat ko bulaya aur usay daraaya aur nasihat ki aur farmaya: Duniya ka azaab aakhirat ke azaab se aasan hai. Us ne kaha: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ne Aap ko haq ke saath bheja hai, mera shohar jhoota hai. Phir Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mard se shuru kiya, to us ne Allah ke naam se chaar gawahiyan din ke wo sachon mein se hai, aur panchwin baar kaha ke us par Allah ki lanat ho agar wo jhooton mein se ho. Phir aurat ko bulaya gaya, to us ne Allah ke naam se chaar gawahiyan din ke wo mard jhooton mein se hai, aur panchwin baar kaha ke us par Allah ka ghazab ho agar wo mard sachon mein se ho. Phir Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un donon ke darmiyan judai kar di. (Muslim)."
"868","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne lian karnay walon se farmaya: Tum donon ka hisab Allah par hai, tum mein se aik jhoota hai. Tumharay liye us par koi rasta nahi. Us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Mera maal? Aap ne farmaya: Tumharay liye koi maal nahi. Agar tum ne us par sach kaha hai to wo us ke badlay hai jo tum ne us ki sharmgah se halal kiya, aur agar tum ne us par jhoot kaha hai to wo tumharay liye us se aur door hai. (Muslim: 4/207)"
"869","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke aik mard ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamanay mein apni biwi se lian kiya. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un donon ke darmiyan judai kar di aur bachay ko us ki maan se milaya. (Muslim: 4/208)"
"870","[AI-translation] Muhammad, yani Ibn Sirin, se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se poocha jabke main samajhta tha ke un ke paas is ka ilm hai. To unhon ne kaha: Beshak Hilal bin Umayya ne apni biwi par Shareek bin Sahma ki taraf se tohmat lagayi, aur wo Umm ki taraf se Bara bin Malik ka bhai tha, aur wo pehla mard tha jis ne Islam mein lian kiya. Unhon ne kaha: To us ne us se lian kiya. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Usay dekhtay raho, agar wo usay gora seedhay baalon wala, aankhon mein kharabi wala le kar aayi to wo Hilal bin Umayya ka hai, aur agar wo usay surmadani aankhon wala, ghungralay baalon wala, patli pindliyon wala le kar aayi to wo Shareek bin Sahma ka hai. Unhon ne kaha: To mujhe khabar di gayi ke wo usay surmadani aankhon wala, ghungralay baalon wala, patli pindliyon wala le kar aayi. (Muslim: 4/209). Baab: Aulad ka inkar aur rag khenchnay ke baaray mein. (Sabt se murad seedhay baal hain; qadi-ul-ainain se murad un ka kharab hona hai; hamsh se murad patla hona hai.)"
"871","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik dehati Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Beshak meri biwi ne kala bacha jana hai. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya tumharay paas oont hain? Us ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Un ka rang kya hai? Us ne kaha: Wo surkh hain. Aap ne farmaya: Kya un mein koi maila rang wala hai? Us ne kaha: Haan, un mein mailay rang walay bhi hain. Aap ne farmaya: Phir ye rang kahan se aaya? Us ne kaha: Kisi rag ne usay khencha hoga. Aap ne farmaya: Phir shayad kisi rag ne tumharay is bachay mein bhi ye rang khencha ho. (Muslim). (Barda kathe ko kehtay hain jo kajawe ke neechay rakha jata hai; maila se murad saaf na honay wala rang hai.)"
"872","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Sa'd bin Abu Waqqas aur Abd bin Zama ghulam ke baaray mein jhagray. To Sa'd ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Ye mere bhai Utba bin Abu Waqqas ka beta hai, us ne mujh se ahad kiya tha ke ye us ka beta hai, us ki mushabihat dekho. Aur Abd bin Zama ne kaha: Ye mera bhai hai, Ae Allah ke Rasool! Ye mere baap ke bistar par us ki londi se paida hua hai. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ki mushabihat dekhi aur Utba se wazeh mushabihat dekhi. To Aap ne farmaya: Wo tumhara hai, Ae Abd! Bacha bistar walay ka hai aur zanikaar ke liye pathar hai. Aur Ae Sauda bint Zama! Tum us se parda karo. Unhon ne kaha: To us ne Sauda ko kabhi nahi dekha. (Muslim: 4/171). Baab: Bachay mein qayafa walon ke qaul ka qabool karna. (Us ke liye pathar se murad nakami hai, bachay mein us ka koi haq nahi; ye ehtiyatan tha kyunke zaahiri shariat mein wo us ka bhai tha.)"
"873","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aik din mere paas khush haal tashreef laye aur farmaya: Ae Aisha! Kya tum ne nahi dekha ke Mujazziz Mudliji mere paas dakhil hua aur us ne Usama aur Zaid ko dekha jabke un par aik chadar thi, unhon ne apne sar dhaanpay hue thay aur un ke paon zaahir thay. To us ne kaha: Beshak ye qadam baaz baaz se hain. (Muslim: 4/172). (Awraq se murad wo rang hai jis mein saaf na honay wala siyahi hai.)"
